        "procedure": "Reaction of [Fe3O(O2CCH2CN)6(H2O)3](NO3)·5H2O, Dy(NO3)3·5H2O and (±)-3-diisopropylamino-1,2-propanediol in a 1 : 1.5 : 5.5 molar ratio in MeOH gave an amorphous yellow powder that was removed by filtration. The filtrate was allowed to stand at room temperature, and orange crystals of 1·0.36H2O·3MeOH grew slowly. The amino-diol is required to isolate the {Fe2Ln4} species but is not incorporated in the product.",
